            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi egyo ndeebya Yuda, n'obu araabe yaareebire oku naabinga mukuru we Israeli, nkamuha ebaruha y'okumushenda nimmutura obushambani bwe bwona, taratiinire, kureka nawe akagyenda, yaaza kuraaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.2.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 2:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okwo kuraaya kumurahukira, yaashiisha ensi, naashambana n'amabaare n'ebiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo byona n'obu biraabe byabaire bityo, egyo ndeebya Yuda tarangarukiire n'omutima gwe gwona, kureka omu kuryarya; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
