        },
        {
          "text": " Omu bunaku obwo Yerusaalemu eryayetwa ekitebe kya MUKAMA eky'obukama, amahanga goona garyakiteeraniraho, ei MUKAMA ariomuri Yerusaalemu, kandi tibarigaruka kukuratira obugangaazi bw'emitima yaabo emibi. ",
